h the given information.\n\nFrom point 12: nice, smart people are quiet. Bob is nice, so if he is smart, he is quiet.\n\nFrom point 9: all furry, nice people are smart. Bob is round (point 2), so if he is round and nice, he is furry, thus he is smart. Therefore, he is smart, so he is quiet.\n\nTherefore, the statement \"Bob is quiet\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Bob is quiet\" is true.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
